export const STATUS_LABELS={saved:"Saved for later",applied:"Applied",screening:"Screening",interviewing:"Interviewing",offer:"Offer",accepted:"Accepted",rejected:"Not selected",withdrawn:"Withdrawn",ghosted:"Gone quiet"},EVENT_LABELS={screen:"Phone screen",interview:"Interview",assessment:"Assessment",offer:"Offer",call:"Call",email:"Email",other:"Other"},OUTCOME_LABELS={pending:"Waiting to hear",passed:"Moved forward",declined:"Did not move forward",none:"No outcome needed"},WORK_MODE_LABELS={onsite:"On site",hybrid:"Hybrid",remote:"Remote",unknown:"Not sure yet"},SORT_LABELS={activity:"Last activity",company:"Company",applied:"Date applied",status:"Status",salary:"Salary"},MATCH_LABELS={company:"the company",role:"the role",location:"the location",source:"the source",notes:"your notes",posting:"the posting",contacts:"a contact",events:"an event",tasks:"a follow-up"},COLLECTION_LABELS={applications:"Application",events:"Event",contacts:"Contact",tasks:"Follow-up"},STATION_LABELS={desk:"Desk",computer:"Computer",calendar:"Calendar",cabinet:"Filing cabinet",board:"Corkboard",rolodex:"Rolodex",whiteboard:"Whiteboard",departures:"Departures board"};export function eventName(e){const t=EVENT_LABELS[e.type];return e.round&&e.type==="interview"?`${t}, round ${e.round}`:t}export function applicationName(e){return e?e.company&&e.role?`${e.company}, ${e.role}`:e.company||e.role:""}export function money(e,t="USD"){try{return new Intl.NumberFormat("en-US",{style:"currency",currency:t,maximumFractionDigits:0}).format(e)}catch{return`${t} ${Math.round(e).toLocaleString("en-US")}`}}export function salaryText(e){const{salaryMin:t,salaryMax:n,salaryCurrency:o}=e;if(t==null&&n==null)return"";const r=e.salaryPeriod==="hour"?"an hour":"a year";return t!=null&&n!=null&&t!==n?`${money(t,o)} to ${money(n,o)} ${r}`:t==null?`Up to ${money(n,o)} ${r}`:`${money(t??n,o)} ${r}`}export function matchNote(e){if(!e||!e.length||e.includes("company")||e.includes("role"))return"";const t=e.map(o=>MATCH_LABELS[o]);return`Found in ${t.length===1?t[0]:`${t.slice(0,-1).join(", ")} and ${t[t.length-1]}`}`}
